blueprint

The numeric defaults in rules.md are adapted, in our own words, from:

- pbakaus/impeccable, licensed under Apache-2.0.
  https://github.com/pbakaus/impeccable
  Changed: the rules were reworded, reordered and reduced to the numbers; the
  prose, the procedure and the tooling are not reused.

- nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill, licensed under MIT.
  https://github.com/nextlevelbuilder/ui-ux-pro-max-skill
  Changed: a small number of thresholds were taken and rewritten.

Contrast ratios come from WCAG 2.2 AA. The 44 by 44 point target comes from
Apple's Human Interface Guidelines. Both are public standards.

gnurio/refactoring-ui-plugin was read and nothing was taken from it: its
LICENSE reserves all rights, whatever its plugin.json claims.
